"""Mounting hole for an M2 screw: a 2.4 mm non-plated drill with no copper.

Footprint from the Micras main board's four screw holes (Altium MicrasMainBoard.PcbDoc: one
2.4 mm NPTH pad, no pad copper), the clearance hole for the M2 flat-head screws that hold the
board to the chassis (MicrasHardware micras/params.py Board.hole_d = 2.4 mm). The board's
mechanical spec places each hole.

Not a purchased part and not electrically connected: no pins, excluded from the BOM and the
placement file.
"""

Component(
    name="MH",
    prefix="H",
    symbol=Symbol(library="MountingHole.kicad_sym"),
    footprint=File("MountingHole_2.4mm_NPTH.kicad_mod"),
    pins={},
    skip_bom=True,
    skip_pos=True,
)
